sentences.text:
This writ petition is filed seeking for following reliefs:
(a) Issue writ of certiorari to quash the order dated 24.05.2022 in proceedings No.KamE05AQA2022(E) issued by the respondent no.1 vide Annexure-A;
(b) Issue a writ of mandamus directing the respondents to consider the representation dated 28.04.2023 issued by the petitioner vide Annexure-B and etc.
